		<article id="post-2" class="post-2 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry">
						<div class="entry-content">
				<h2>CSI Baseball is a life-long fraternity of brothers. Alumni weekend gives us an opportunity to reconnect with former teammates and build relationships with other alum.</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
							</div><!-- .entry-content -->
					</article><!-- #post-## -->

	</div><!-- .hero -->


	
	



	<div id="quinary" class="front-page-widget-area" role="complementary">
		<div class="front-page-widget-wrapper clear">
							<div class="front-page-widget">
					<aside id="text-7" class="widget widget_text"><h2 class="widget-title">Message from Skip and Boomer&#8230;</h2>			<div class="textwidget"><p>We would like to invite all CSI Baseball Alumni to join our annual Alumni Weekend where you can get back on the field, take some BP, catch up with some old friends and even play in the alumni game!</p>
<p>No events are currently scheduled at this time but check back to see whats coming!</p>
<p>~ Skip and Boomer ~</p>
</div>
		</aside>				</div><!-- .front-page-widget -->
			
